.TH VOXEL-BOROUGHS-SERVER 6 "August 2026" "Voxel Boroughs" "Games"
.SH NAME
voxel-boroughs-server \- headless Voxel Boroughs development server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B voxel-boroughs-server
.RI --gameid voxel_boroughs --world pathname [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the authoritative Voxel Boroughs Lua simulation without the graphical client.
.SH SECURITY
Public hosting is not supported by the pre-alpha. Bind development servers to a trusted LAN address and disable server-list announcement.

